# =============================================================================
# Dwelling Frontend — Static Hosting Routing & Proxy Configuration
# Compatible with Render.com Static Sites, Netlify, and Cloudflare Pages
# =============================================================================

# 1. API Reverse Proxy Rewrite
# Forwards relative /api calls from the static frontend to the Render backend service.
# Eliminates 404 errors on relative /api calls and avoids CORS preflight overhead.
/api/*  https://dwelling-api.onrender.com/api/:splat  200!

# 2. Multi-Page Clean URL Rewrites (allows visiting routes without explicit .html)
/login                  /pages/login.html                  200
/register               /pages/register.html               200
/properties             /pages/properties.html             200
/property-details       /pages/property-details.html       200
/profile                /pages/profile.html                200
/add-property           /pages/add-property.html           200

# 3. Pages Subdirectory Clean URL Rewrites
/pages/login            /pages/login.html                  200
/pages/register         /pages/register.html               200
/pages/properties       /pages/properties.html             200
/pages/property-details /pages/property-details.html       200
/pages/profile          /pages/profile.html                200
/pages/add-property     /pages/add-property.html           200
